{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AmortizationEntries\">Amortization Entries</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntries Assets Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets On\">The <strong>Amortization Entries</strong> tab documents the gradual reduction in value of intangible assets, a process known as amortization.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization Assets Expenses Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets On To ToDate\">Here you can record periodic amortization expenses to reflect the declining value of intangible assets over their useful life.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-sort-amount-down text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AmortizationEntries\">Amortization Entries</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntries On\">Creating Amortization Entries</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntry Create NewAmortizationEntry On To ToDate\">To create a new amortization entry, click the <strong>New Amortization Entry</strong> button.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"AmortizationEntries\">Amortization Entries</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewAmortizationEntry\">New Amortization Entry</span></span></div></div><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On\">For more information, see:</span> <a href=\"/guides/amortization-entry-form\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amortization\">Amortization</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Edit\">Edit</span></a></p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Column Columns\">Understanding the Columns</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntries Column Columns Is On\">The <strong>Amortization Entries</strong> tab displays information in the following columns:</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntry Column Date Is On\">The <strong>Date</strong> column displays the date of the amortization entry.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reference\">Reference</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntry Column Is On Reference\">The <strong>Reference</strong> column displays the reference number for each amortization entry.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntry Column Description Is On\">The <strong>Description</strong> column displays the description of the amortization entry.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"IntangibleAssets\">Intangible Assets</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"IntangibleAssets\">Intangible Assets</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntry Assets By Column Intangible_asset IntangibleAsset IntangibleAssets Is On Rate\">The <strong>Intangible Assets</strong> column displays the intangible assets affected by this amortization entry, separated by commas.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Division\">Division</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Division\">Division</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization AmortizationEntry Column Division Divisions Is On\">The <strong>Division</strong> column displays the divisions associated with this amortization entry.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amortization Amount Column Is Line Lines On To ToDate Total\">The <strong>Amount</strong> column displays the total amortization amount for all lines in the entry.</p></div></details><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Columns Custom Customize Edit EditColumns Is On To ToDate\">Click the <strong>Edit Columns</strong> button to customize which columns are visible.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pb-4 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 p-3 border-b\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"border text-xs rounded py-1 px-2 bg-white border-neutral-300 text-neutral-400\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EditColumns\">Edit columns</span></span></div></div></div><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"LearnMore\">Learn more about:</span> <a href=\"/guides/edit-columns\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EditColumns\">Edit columns</span></a></p>",
  "key": "amortization-entries"
}
